  "modification_notes": [
    "Antigravity Agent Manager stdio adapter and host-managed permission integration; standalone human dialogs remain available.",
    "Native identity/action fencing, independent cancellation and worker/input recovery.",
    "Original continuous glow, compact native HUD, live pointer halo and temporary native arrow with independent crash watchdog.",
    "Prebuilt Windows packaging and preserving installer/rollback.",
    "2026-10-24: direct skill-script IPC replaces the default MCP transport; the native runtime and optional compatibility adapter share the same validated action catalogue.",
    "2026-10-24: added build-bound requests, streaming UTF-8 decoding, bounded observation settling from real editor feedback, control-generation fencing, persistent native emergency Stop and normal idle-shutdown distinction; visual edge field and cursor contrast refined.",
    "2026-10-24 dev4: native-worker epoch fencing, explicit input-delivery evidence when verification fails, foreground diagnostics, Unicode joiner/bidi preservation and fail-closed held-input cleanup; fixes driven by real Upscaly and ComposeDoc use.",
    "dev4 shutdown correction: acknowledge closure only after native cleanup succeeds, serialize concurrent shutdowns and keep failed cleanup reachable for recovery.",
    "dev5: explicit unavailable-service diagnostics and refusal to replace a live unresponsive service after timeout. Native helper remains byte-identical to dev4.",
    "dev6: actual Antigravity feedback added per-command schema discovery and ASCII-safe JSON across legacy PowerShell stdout. Skill explicitly launches/observes prebuilt apps before inferring missing development services. Native helper unchanged.",
    "dev7: complete schema discovery for intrinsic start/shutdown/describe commands and conventional COMMAND --help. Native helper unchanged; actual Antigravity dev6 image/semantic/Unicode path witnessed. The actual Agent Manager JPEG-viewing tool is read_file, distinguished from IDE view_file documentation.",
    "dev7 capture hardening: replace five sampled visibility points with bounded full Z-order rectangle intersection checks; forbid covered-screen fallback after failed window rendering; discard a screen frame if coverage changes; Node rejects legacy screen_occluded replies. Native helper rebuilt from changed source; live old/new qualification remains recorded separately.",
    "0.3.0-beta.1: separable glow falloff cache, stronger soft edge field, smaller halo, distinct original text insertion cursor and role hotspot; installer manifest preflight before writes; protocol test isolation preserves real Stop state; canonical LF provenance checked in CI.",
    "Beta real Notepad reproduction: UIA SetFocus activated RichEditD2DPT child53480184 under approved root11536664. Compare GA_ROOT parents on every key, never GA_ROOTOWNER or same-PID alone; retain indexed focus validation and refuse other roots. Add native class/root/owner diagnostics and boundary regression.",
    "Beta final real Notepad fixes: short paced native typing capped400 units; avoid redundant field focus; explicit paste reuses upstream clipboard-preserving implementation with stricter unknown-format refusal and exceptional-cleanup sequence recheck; Save As uses committed keyboard filename and refuses mismatched path. Real saved94-unit native and1209-unit full paste comparisons pass.",
    "Speed candidate: strict named CLI flags and brief output, automatic bounded private timing receipts, exact-process launch/observe, short installer launcher with rollback, batch preflight and final-checkpoint capture. Actual Agent Manager latency rerun is pending.",
    "Speed hardening: direct Node entrypoint preserves literal argv instead of a CMD forwarding wrapper; scoped project launchers cannot repoint global, live-service install refuses before writes, and ambiguous/incomplete batch target shapes refuse before input. Exact1319-unit real Notepad save and Upscaly batched import witnessed on speed1; actual App comparison awaits human window restoration.",
    "Owned WPF provider baseline reproduced dispatch-then-error followed by duplicate physical input and before-effect refusal followed by physical input. Native click/MSAA/file-dialog confirmation now refuse automatic alternate actions after dispatch errors and return input_outcome_unknown. Qualification pending. Also track file-dialog held-input recovery, register first-launch/window-free workers with guardian and preserve worker epoch, and refuse unsealed bundle extras.",
    "Reusable native WPF provider regression fails olda2 and passes candidatea2fd with exactly one dispatch, correct effect counters and no physical replay. Clarify host-managed comment for direct terminal integration. Ordinary-app and host acceptance still pending.",
    "Work branch: actual reviewed2 Save filename stream dropped a character; exact-path guard refused confirmation. Add explicit clipboard filename entry reusing preserved-format PasteCore within the owned-dialog fence; default keyboard and Native confirmation authority remain unchanged. New mode native qualification pending.",
    "Private-storage work: actual inherited Windows ACLs were too broad. Add separate prebuilt ACL helper (no UI/elevation), dedicated/private anchor and payload sealing, ancestor/link/owner/root refusal, legacy ACL journal, data protection, migration Stop/preferences without capabilities, deployment pointers/rollback, retained direct policy and same-build policy binding. Actual NTFS and installer/IPC tests pass; full new install/host qualification pending."
  ],
